hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.essence_bond.name=Essence Bond
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.essence_bond.description=Unlock the summoned form's owner passive: Fire—your hits burn for 2 damage each second for 4 seconds; Ice—your hits slow movement by 20% for 4 seconds; Lightning—gain 15% horizontal movement speed; Nature—heal 1% of maximum health every 2 seconds; Toxic—your hits reduce outgoing damage by 12% for 6 seconds; Void—your hits increase damage taken by 12% for 6 seconds. Wild has no Bond passive yet.
